Offline-first task manager with priority scoring and sync conflict resolution. Built for Code Comprehension exercise.

## Features
- Task model with UUID, priority enum, status workflow
- Priority scoring: LOW=10, MEDIUM=20, HIGH=40, URGENT=60 + due date + tags
- Text parser: parses "!HIGH #tag tomorrow" into Task object
- Offline sync: merge_task_lists() with DONE-wins + Last-Write-Wins

